WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.439
How could the Church

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.319
not be interested in the construction of Europe,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.079
when the Church has been ingrained

00:00:13.319 --> 00:00:17.119
in the people of Europe for centuries?

00:00:21.839 --> 00:00:25.720
The empires of the past invaded everything

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.600
and tried to establish their domination

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.839
by the force of coercion

00:00:33.159 --> 00:00:35.720
and the politics of assimilation.

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:37.720
Your Europe

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:43.479
will be that of the free association of all peoples

00:00:44.159 --> 00:00:50.400
and the sharing of the many riches of their diversity.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.519
Religious fundamentalism,

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.239
which does not distinguish

00:00:58.239 --> 00:01:02.319
between the spheres of faith and civil life,

00:01:02.519 --> 00:01:07.839
is today still practised elsewhere.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.280
It seems incompatible with the unique spirit in which

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:17.600
Europe shaped the Christian message.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:26.319
Reconcile man and creation,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.639
by making sure the integrity of nature is preserved -

00:01:32.039 --> 00:01:34.000
the flora and fauna,

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.879
the air and the rivers,

00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:40.479
a subtle balance...

00:01:44.959 --> 00:01:49.280
Reconcile man with his fellow man -

00:01:49.839 --> 00:01:53.839
by accepting each other as Europeans

00:01:54.479 --> 00:01:56.959
with diverse cultural traditions

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.600
and schools of thought,

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:04.639
by being welcoming to foreigners and refugees,

00:02:05.039 --> 00:02:06.720
by being open to the spiritual riches

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.639
of the peoples of other continents.

00:02:10.079 --> 00:02:14.879
Work to rebuild an integrated and complete vision

00:02:15.079 --> 00:02:17.200
of man and the world,

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:24.439
one that counters the culture of suspicion and dehumanisation:

00:02:24.879 --> 00:02:30.039
a vision where science, technology and art

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:34.959
do not exclude - but call for - faith in God.

00:02:35.159 --> 00:02:37.479
In responding to your invitation

00:02:37.479 --> 00:02:40.400
to address your illustrious assembly,

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:43.200
I had before me the eyes of the millions

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.920
of European men and women you represent.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:52.600
They have entrusted you with the great task

00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:56.400
of maintaining and developing the human,

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.000
cultural and spiritual values

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:03.079
which make up the heritage of Europe

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.159
- and which will be the best safeguard of its identity,

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:12.000
its freedom and its progress.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.759
I pray to God to inspire you,

00:03:15.959 --> 00:03:19.360
to strengthen you in this great destiny.

00:03:19.759 --> 00:03:21.319
Thank you.

